-- The lecture theatre (the book's Area 2 map, 9A), redrawn in our pieces. Turned half round from the
-- book's page, like the Hunting Grounds, so its door from the hall is on the west and the lecturer's
-- lectern stands at the far end, the blackboard behind him. The book's two rows of benches face
-- him with an aisle down the middle; blown up to fill the mat, with the blanketed windows, the
-- cobwebs, the piles of dull books and the carpet of ghostly notes from its words. The south wall
-- is left off.

